WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.930
(upbeat music)

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:06.013
- [Narrator] Two words,
snail slime, snail slime.

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:20.770
Snails love their own slime,

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.436
which is actually their mucus.

00:00:22.436 --> 00:00:26.656
It helps them defy gravity
and move at a snail's pace.

00:00:26.656 --> 00:00:27.920
Bad cliché.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.073
But humans also love snail slime

00:00:30.073 --> 00:00:31.787
for its nutrient-rich properties.

00:00:31.787 --> 00:00:34.593
This began thousands of
years ago when ancient Romans

00:00:34.593 --> 00:00:38.045
and Greeks gave snails free
rein to roam their faces.

00:00:38.045 --> 00:00:40.319
No more redness, no more wrinkles

00:00:40.319 --> 00:00:42.073
for our classical ancestors.

00:00:42.073 --> 00:00:45.740
(speaking foreign language)

00:00:48.892 --> 00:00:53.298
That is kinda off topic,
Simone, but now that you're here,

00:00:53.298 --> 00:00:54.710
I think we should segue
to your introduction.

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:58.377
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:02.669 --> 00:01:03.724
He's being modest.

00:01:03.724 --> 00:01:06.655
Simone is an inventor and a snail savior.

00:01:06.655 --> 00:01:09.984
Before he invented his snail
slime extraction machine,

00:01:09.984 --> 00:01:12.899
the only way to collect mass
quantities of snail slime

00:01:12.899 --> 00:01:16.516
resulted in the snail's
death, not anymore.

00:01:16.516 --> 00:01:20.183
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:35.058 --> 00:01:36.975
We begin in the fields.

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:43.012
After munching for 14
months, snails are plucked,

00:01:43.012 --> 00:01:47.179
washed, and brought to Simone's
machine, the Muller One.

00:01:48.777 --> 00:01:52.274
Sidebar, snails secrete
slime for three reasons:

00:01:52.274 --> 00:01:55.691
to move, out of stress, and for pleasure.

00:01:56.942 --> 00:01:59.421
Simone calls his machine a spa for snails

00:01:59.421 --> 00:02:01.660
because it pleasures
them with a secret spray

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:04.542
to the point that they
secrete a lot of slime.

00:02:04.542 --> 00:02:08.209
(speaking foreign language)

00:02:11.563 --> 00:02:13.435
If you don't talk metric, I'll translate.

00:02:13.435 --> 00:02:17.602
That's as much as seven pounds
of slime from one batch.

00:02:18.588 --> 00:02:21.634
After that, the slime is
extracted, dehydrated,

00:02:21.634 --> 00:02:25.801
rehydrated, and then refined
here for use in cosmetics.

00:02:27.139 --> 00:02:30.589
Here it is being bottled, and
then it's off to your face.

00:02:30.589 --> 00:02:34.256
(speaking foreign language)

00:02:45.753 --> 00:02:47.863
- Best slime in the world.

00:02:47.863 --> 00:02:51.234
- [Narrator] Simone,
if being bold is wrong,

00:02:51.234 --> 00:02:53.484
we don't want to be right.

